# Line endings.
#
# Prettier is configured for LF and the repo is stored that way, but Git on
# Windows re-materialises the working tree as CRLF on checkout — so
# `npm run format:check` failed locally after a branch switch while passing in
# CI, with `git diff` showing nothing to explain it.
#
# Declaring it here makes the working tree match what the tooling expects on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
